<title>UK: Gullfaks system to load 20 cargoes in Jan - trade.</title>
<headline>Gullfaks system to load 20 cargoes in Jan - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Gullfaks crude system is scheduled to load 20 standard 850,000 barrel cargoes in January, unchanged on the December schedule, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Tom Ashby, London Newsroom</p>
</text>
